{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teddy Roller 2</strong> is an arcade game with physics elements. The goal is to navigate various levels and reach the goal at the end of each stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/92146b7ddfc4c9a387f050e4aa89fc9b.poster.avif?t=1757076477\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/92146b7ddfc4c9a387f050e4aa89fc9b.webm?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/92146b7ddfc4c9a387f050e4aa89fc9b.mp4?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character balances on a ball of yarn as various creatures seek to knock him off balance and fling him to the ground. The game offers an intuitive blend of rolling ball physics and precision platforming.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/b19c7ffd88c2f2b3c1f2df40b3e943b3.poster.avif?t=1757076477\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/b19c7ffd88c2f2b3c1f2df40b3e943b3.webm?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/b19c7ffd88c2f2b3c1f2df40b3e943b3.mp4?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>3-D</strong> platforming intervals where the player is given respite in beautiful environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/77f37ff9e1f0bec12b21ed2e2d088033.poster.avif?t=1757076477\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/77f37ff9e1f0bec12b21ed2e2d088033.webm?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/77f37ff9e1f0bec12b21ed2e2d088033.mp4?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has over <strong>90</strong> extravagant stages to be bested.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique physics system guarantees that no playthrough stays the same.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intuitive control scheme ensures smooth navigation. The player simply accelerates or decelerates, whilst turning left and right.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stages change the camera angle for a novel way to experience the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/6ba1b7d077be036a808c1a23effa06bf.poster.avif?t=1757076477\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/6ba1b7d077be036a808c1a23effa06bf.webm?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/6ba1b7d077be036a808c1a23effa06bf.mp4?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game targets a native <strong>100-120FPS</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391920?t=1757076477","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391920?t=1757076477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/4629d06ce41e6e93a6166df6af8c357046d60c73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757076477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/4629d06ce41e6e93a6166df6af8c357046d60c73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757076477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teddy Roller 2</strong> is an arcade game with physics elements. The goal is to navigate various levels and reach the goal at the end of each stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/92146b7ddfc4c9a387f050e4aa89fc9b.poster.avif?t=1757076477\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/92146b7ddfc4c9a387f050e4aa89fc9b.webm?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391920/extras/92146b7ddfc4c9a387f050e4aa89fc9b.mp4?t=1757076477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character balances on a ball of yarn as various creatures seek to knock him off balance and fling him to the g